    "q-1931": {
      "dom_id": "step-q1931",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Differentiate ${e}^{x}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x.$",
      "worked_solution": "Here, we have the product of the two functions $u(x)={e}^{x}$ and $v(x)=\\operatorname{tan}⁡x.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({e}^{x}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)^{′} & ={u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)+u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =({e}^{x})^{′}\\cdot \\operatorname{tan}⁡x+{e}^{x}\\cdot (\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)^{′} \\\\  & =({e}^{x})(\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)+({e}^{x})({sec}^{2}⁡x) \\\\  & ={e}^{x}{sec}^{2}⁡x+{e}^{x}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-1931-a",
